   | %% | mORE dOORS 1.5 (aMiEXPRESS)                               | %% |
   | %% | bY zALO / uP! /X 2026                                     | %% |
   | %% |                                                           | %% |
   | %% | Description                                               | %% |
   | %% | -----------                                               | %% |
   | %% | Second-level cursor menu for AmiExpress BBS systems.      | %% |
   | %% | Ideal when your main menu has too many doors to fit.      | %% |
   | %% | Users browse extra doors and launch them quickly.         | %% |
   | %% | Access filtering hides commands they cannot run.          | %% |
   | %% |                                                           | %% |
   | %% | Components                                                | %% |
   | %% | ----------                                                | %% |
   | %% | MOREDOORS      - Main XIM door binary                     | %% |
   | %% | MOREDOORS.info - BBSCmd command icon                      | %% |
   | %% | moredoors.cfg  - Menu configuration file                  | %% |
   | %% |                                                           | %% |
   | %% | Install                                                   | %% |
   | %% | -------                                                   | %% |
   | %% | 1) Put MOREDOORS in BBS:Doors/MOREDOORS/                  | %% |
   | %% | 2) Put MOREDOORS.info in BBS:Commands/BBSCmd/             | %% |
   | %% | 3) Put moredoors.cfg in the same drawer as MOREDOORS      | %% |
   | %% | 4) Make sure MOREDOORS.info has:                          | %% |
   | %% |    TYPE.......... XIM                                     | %% |
   | %% |    LOCATION...... BBS:Doors/MOREDOORS/MOREDOORS           | %% |
   | %% |    MULTINODE..... YES                                     | %% |
   | %% |    ACCESS........ 10                                      | %% |
   | %% |                                                           | %% |
   | %% | Main Functions                                            | %% |
   | %% | --------------                                            | %% |
   | %% | - Cursor navigation with arrows or 8426 fallback          | %% |
   | %% | - Direct hotkeys for visible entries on each page         | %% |
   | %% | - Remembers the last launched door per user slot          | %% |
   | %% | - Home/End support and column/page wrapping               | %% |
   | %% | - Compact page indicator and quick redraws                | %% |
